                <pb facs="0496" n="416" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg416"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Newel to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Sgravenhage</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic">February 7,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Her Majesty Wilhelmina, Queen of The Netherlands and Princess of Orange-Nassau,
                    married Duke Henry of Mecklenburg-Schwerin at 12.30 to-day. The streets filled
                    with thousands of happy people in brilliant sunshine.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Newel.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
